  {"i":4607,"t":["qualities"],"s":{"2":["health"],"4":["numbers"]},"n":"Degree/adjustment is the core; health condition and addition/subtraction (加減乗除) are distinct common senses, so they go in sense entries"},
  {"i":4608,"t":["qualities"],"n":"Learners meet it as taking on a quality or tinge (赤みを帯びる); wearing a sword is rare"},
  {"i":4628,"t":["festivals"],"n":"Holding events, exhibitions and games fits an events unit; business and sports are loose associations"},
  {"i":4631,"t":["thinking"],"n":"策 alone means plan or means; the policy sense comes from compounds like 政策"},
  {"i":4643,"t":["technology"],"n":"Taught as account or membership registration; society is too loose"},
  {"i":4647,"t":["actions"],"n":"Adjusting by feel or going easy is an action; relationships is a loose fit"},
  {"i":4659,"t":["thinking","communication"],"s":{"2":["language"]},"n":"Affirmation fits thinking and communication; affirmative (肯定形/肯定文) is a grammar term met in language lessons"},
  {"i":4674,"t":["health"],"n":"Medical tests (健康検査, 血液検査) are the main teaching context; science and work are both loose second topics"},
  {"i":4687,"t":["actions"],"s":{"2":["character"]},"n":"Pretending (〜ふりをする) is an action, not a trait; only the appearance/behaviour sense fits character"},
  {"i":4691,"t":["sports","arts","work"],"n":"Learners mostly meet it as team coach or film director, so sports and arts come before work"},
  {"i":4733,"t":["plants"],"n":"Harvest is a farming word; the figurative 'gain, result' sense is general and not specific to work"},
  {"i":4742,"t":["qualities"],"n":"Manner adverb (finely, in detail), not a function word of degree or negation"},
  {"i":4748,"t":["animals"],"n":"A tail is an animal part, not part of the human body unit"}
